From: Christophe Priouzeau <christophe.priouzeau@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 26 Jun 2024 16:42:34 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 21/22] v4l2codecs: Add V4L2 H264 stateless encoder

Using v4l2 request to set driver configuration by using H264 stateless controls.

Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 gst-libs/gst/codecs/gsth264encoder.c |  289 +++---
 gst-libs/gst/codecs/gsth264frame.h   |    2 +-
 sys/v4l2codecs/gstv4l2codech264enc.c | 1236 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++
